  "description": "PIS is a remote sensing foundation model pretraining approach that promotes intra-instance similarity by leveraging both seasonal (temporal) and artificial augmentations to expand the positive representation space, enabling robust and generalizable feature extraction for various downstream remote sensing tasks.",
